      "desc:8": "§6Machine type: §aBee Engineer§r\n\nController of the Bee Engineer\nStill in test.\nTransforming drones into princesses.\nWho knows how many drones became stepping stones for the Last Queen?\nCost 128kL Honey to transform a drone into princess, but with 40% failing chance.\nWill try to consume 32kL UUM (if exists) to increase success rate to 80%.\nIn case of failure, all consumed ingredients will not be returned.\nDon't put too many drones in at once, that will result in a long run time!\n\n[note]Hatches[/note]: Input Bus, Input Hatch, Output Bus\nUse a Hologram Projector (or the NEI structure preview) to see and auto-build the structure.\n\n[note]Controller recipe[/note]: Assembler, ZPM\n - 64x Bronze Frame Box\n - 4x Field Generator Lu V\n - 16x Electric Pump Lu V\n - 16x Conveyor Module Lu V\n - 64x Plutonium241 Fine Wire\n - 16x UHV Circuit\n - 256,000 L Honey",
